OL,3,GNEWSARSPB marks 50 years at
OL,4,Awildlife-rich reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nature reserve tucked away on the
OL,7,FBroads and home to some of Norfolk's
OL,8,Fmost threatened wildlife is celebrating
OL,9,F50 years.
OL,11,FStrumpshaw Fen covers 450 hectares
OL,12,F(1,112 acres) of diverse wetland ` the
OL,13,Fequivalent of 630 football pitches.
OL,15,FReserves manager Helen Deavin said the
OL,16,Fsite supported "rare and unusual
OL,17,Fspecies", including nesting bitterns,
OL,18,Fthe swallowtail butterfly and a pair of
OL,19,Fcranes that successfully raised a chick
OL,20,Fthis summer.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
