OL,4,Awildlife-rich reserve
OL,5,
OL,6,F"One of the lovely things about
OL,7,FStrumpshaw is that the wildlife is
OL,8,Fquite accessible," added Deavin, who
OL,9,Fcalled the reserve a "hidden gem".
